{{#if extended}}
<h1>Your courtesy Pro was extended</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>Your courtesy Pro on <strong>{{appName}}</strong> now lasts until <strong>{{endsAt}}</strong>.</p>
{{else}}
<h1>You got courtesy Pro</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>The <strong>{{appName}}</strong> team unlocked <strong>Pro</strong> on your account, for free, until <strong>{{endsAt}}</strong>.</p>
{{/if}}
<p>Nothing is charged: when the courtesy ends, the account goes back to the free plan on its own (we will remind you a few days before).</p>
{{> button url=billingUrl label="See my plan"}}
